<title>USA: Lockheed, Raytheon, TRW say they form missile co.</title>
<headline>Lockheed, Raytheon, TRW say they form missile co.</headline>
<dateline>CRYSTAL CITY, Va. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lockheed Martin, Raytheon Co and TRW Inc said Tuesday they formed a joint venture to help the U.S. government build a missile defense system.</p>
<p>The companines said they each equally own the venture, which is called United Missile Defense Co.</p>
<p>The companies said their employees will staff United Missile Defense Co.</p>
<p>The companies said the executive staff and some personnel of the new venture are in the process of relocating to Crystal City.</p>
</text>
